+        """Where we expect the deal to end, as a share of its opening, when no should-cost of its own
+        plant exists. EVAL arm `signals`: the dossier's own reading of the supplier moves it - a list
+        price it cannot move or a margin it will not give up (docs/PLAN.md section 10: "the price is
